<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-044" chapter-id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan" source-id="s-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan-ws2027785">
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p001:m0000" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>膽力之士<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p001:m0006" ref="z20_oiz_tbh">王沖天</persName>不勝忿，乃率黨度洲攻壘斬<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p001:m0021" ref="xto_ews_eyo">略</persName>，而<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p001:m0024" ref="2yz_7xj_cx7">諧之</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p001:m0027" ref="u4m_so3_3c0">法亮</persName>單艇奔逸。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">上又遣丹陽尹<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0006" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_A">蕭順之</persName>領兵繼之，<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0014" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>即日將白衣左右三十人，乘舴艋中流下都。初，<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0037" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_A">順之</persName>將發，文惠太子素忌<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0048" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>，密遣不許還，令便為之所。<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0063" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>及見<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0067" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_A">順之</persName>，欲自申明，<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0075" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_A">順之</persName>不許，於射堂縊之。有司奏絕<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p002:m0090" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>屬籍，賜為蛸氏。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p003:m0000" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>密作啟數紙，藏妃<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zixiang-nan:p003:m0010" ref="dy9_5il_1gc">王氏</persName>裙腰中，具自申明</p>
</text>
